; frost_cliffs.room - Penhascos: the bench in a cave under the west crag (cols 1-12, rows 41-44), then a climb
; by single jumps between the crag and the east cliff (ledges 3-4 rows apart, 2-cell gaps) to the cliff top
; (row 9) and the lighthouse (design 04 section 3.3). No gate: base kit, no earth.

